    "# 01. TCN-GRU Model Benchmarking Notebook\n",
    "## AI-Assisted Resilience for SDN-Enabled Intelligent Transportation Systems\n",
    "**Author:** Trinh Hoang Tu (Tsinghua IEDE Autumn 2026 Batch | NexusShield AI)\n",
    "**Advisor:** Prof. Kris Singh\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates:\n",
    "1. Time-series flow-level telemetry feature preprocessing.\n",
    "2. PyTorch hybrid **TCN-GRU Autoencoder & Classifier** model training.\n",
    "3. Adaptive Reconstruction Error threshold calibration $\\tau = \\mu_{RE} + k \\cdot \\sigma_{RE}$.\n",
    "4. Experimental Benchmarking: TCN-GRU vs. LSTM vs. Vanilla GRU/RNN."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys\n",
    "import os\n",
    "sys.path.append('..')\n",
    "\n",
    "import torch\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "from data.data_loader import TelemetryDataLoader, LABEL_MAPPING\n",
    "from models.tcn_gru import TCNGRUResilienceModel\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"[*] PyTorch Version: {torch.__version__}\")\n",
    "print(f"[*] Compute Device:  {'CUDA GPU' if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'CPU'}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Step 1: Telemetry Data Generation & Feature Preprocessing"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "loader = TelemetryDataLoader(seq_len=10, batch_size=32)\n",
    "train_dl, val_dl, test_dl = loader.get_synthetic_loaders(num_samples=2000)\n",
    "\n",
    "x_sample, y_sample = next(iter(train_dl))\n",
    "print(f"Train Batch X Shape: {x_sample.shape} | Batch Y Shape: {y_sample.shape}\")\n",
    "print(\"Sample Flow Feature Vector (t=0):\\n\", x_sample[0, 0].numpy())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Step 2: Instantiate & Train Hybrid TCN-GRU Model"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "device = torch.device('cuda' if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'cpu')\n",
    "model = TCNGRUResilienceModel(num_features=10, num_classes=len(LABEL_MAPPING)).to(device)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Forward pass check\n",
    "x_hat, logits = model(x_sample.to(device))\n",
    "print(f\"Reconstruction output shape: {x_hat.shape}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Class logits shape:          {logits.shape}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Step 3: Experimental Benchmark Comparison (TCN-GRU vs LSTM vs GRU)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
