    "    'F1-Score (%)': [89.8, 93.9, 95.1, 98.1],\n",
    "    'Detection Latency (ms)': [14.2, 11.5, 8.7, 3.8],\n",
    "    'Model Size (MB)': [1.8, 2.4, 1.2, 0.75]\n",
    "})\n",
    "\n",
    "display(benchmark_df)"
   ]
